// State space for mathematical reasoning
State(4096) → reasoning_space
WaveState(2048) → solution_wave

// Problem: Felipe tells Roberto that he managed to place 1226 triminos $1\times 3$ on a certain grid square $Q$ so that they do not have common points, not even vertices. Without knowing the dimensions of $Q$, R...

